Were you, I'm very curious because,

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:08.210
I'm curious what you were like as a child.

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:10.380
Whenever I meet a performer
who's particularly interesting

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.770
