that person like as a child?

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:15.048
Were you Pee-Wee as a child?

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:16.847
To a degree, I was.

00:00:16.847 --> 00:00:18.410
[Conan] Yeah.

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:20.900
This'll sort of illustrate
who I was as a kid.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:23.620
I was probably five or six years old.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:25.940
I had a younger sister
a year younger than me.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:28.410
I have a younger sister,
a year younger than me.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:31.210
And she got for her birthday or Christmas

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.290
or something one time,
she got a little tea set,

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.250
which she was like, (gagging)
I don't want this tea set.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.650
I, me, I was mesmerized by
the tea set, immediately.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:39.880
I was like, you don't
want this, are you insane?

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:41.593
What is wrong with you,
ya know. (audience laughs)

00:00:41.593 --> 00:00:43.370
You can serve miniature tea with this.

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:44.300
Yeah, and I mean, and it was that thing.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.250
It was like a little cup,

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.083
this big.
Sure.

00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:48.490
And so I like, freaked out when I saw it

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:51.550
and I was like, I'll take
it, you know, I'll take it.

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.030
And my Dad noticed that
and my Dad went like,

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:56.100
