00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.930
My Dad had never said anything
like that to me before.

00:00:57.930 --> 00:00:59.050
I was like, are you kidding me?

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:00.687
Like, you wanna have a tea party?

00:01:00.687 --> 00:01:01.520
(audience laughs)

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.036
Give me three minutes, you know?

00:01:03.036 --> 00:01:04.014
(audience laughs)

00:01:04.014 --> 00:01:06.670
I ran upstairs to my room,
I had like, you know,

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:07.740
little kid furniture,

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:08.573
like a little chair.
Sure.

00:01:08.573 --> 00:01:10.040
And a little table and stuff, so I went

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:11.080
and filled up the tea pot

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:13.110
and set out like a little,
little, what do you call it?

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:14.940
Saucer, I'm getting so excited
just thinking about it.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:17.010
Yeah, yeah.
(audience laughs)

